yokugqibela ihamba kwangoko. Ikomiti iza kubuza nangendlela yokuthutha.","cognitive_level":{"code":"L2","label":"Reorganisation","band":"lower"}},{"question":"Leliphi igama eligcina umahluko obalulekileyo kwisishwankathelo?","options":["Abaninzi","Bonke","Akukho namnye","Ngokuqinisekileyo wonke umntu"],"correct_index":0,"explanation":"Abaninzi alithethi bonke. Ukugcina eli gama kuthintela ukwandisa ibango ngaphezu kobungqina.","stimulus":"IKomiti yesikolo icebisa indawo yokufunda emva kwemini. Abafundi abaninzi bayasixhasa isindululo, kodwa abanye bathi iteksi yabo yokugqibela ihamba kwangoko. Ikomiti iza kubuza nangendlela yokuthutha.","cognitive_level":{"code":"L1","label":"Literal","band":"lower"}},{"question":"Leliphi ibango elilungelelanisiweyo?","options":["Inkqubo iqinisekisa impumelelo kubo bonke.","Akukho mfundi unokuxhamla.","Isibhengezo sele singqine unobangela.","Omnye umfundi uxela inzuzo; kufuneka uphando olubanzi."],"correct_index":3,"explanation":"Isivakalisi sigcina ubungqina obukhoyo size sicacise umda waso. Musa ukuthembisa okungalinganiswanga.","stimulus":"Umbutho uthi inkqubo yawo inyusa amanqaku. Kwisibhengezo kusetyenziswa impendulo yomfundi omnye. Akunikwa amanqaku angaphambi kwenkqubo okanye iqela lokuthelekisa.","cognitive_level":{"code":"L4","label":"Evaluation","band":"higher"}},{"question":"Yeyiphi idatha enokwenza uvavanyo lube ngcono?","options":["Amanqaku angaphambi nasemva kunye neqela elithelekisekayo.","Inani lemibala kwisibhengezo kuphela.","Igama lomshicileli kuphela.","Ubungakanani belogo kuphela."],"correct_index":0,"explanation":"Uthelekiso olucwangciswe kakuhle lunceda ukuvavanya utshintsho kunye nezinye izinto ezinokuluchaza.","stimulus":"Umbutho uthi inkqubo yawo inyusa amanqaku. Kwisibhengezo kusetyenziswa impendulo yomfundi omnye. Akunikwa amanqaku angaphambi kwenkqubo okanye iqela lokuthelekisa.","cognitive_level":{"code":"L4","label":"Evaluation","band":"higher"}},{"question":"Ukutshintsha ibango libe abanye abafundi banokuzuza kuyilungisa njani ingxaki?","options":["Kungqina ukuba bonke abafundi baya kuphumelela.","Kwenza ukuthelekisa kungabi yimfuneko.","Kunciphisa ukubaxa, kodwa uphando olubanzi lusafuneka ukuhlola inzuzo.","Kungqina ukuba akukho mfundi unokuzuza."],"correct_index":2,"explanation":"Ulwimi olulumkileyo alusenzi ubungqina obutsha. Ingxelo yomfundi omnye isenomda, ngoko ibango elithobekileyo lisafuna ukuhlolwa ngendlela efanelekileyo.","cognitive_level":{"code":"L4","label":"Evaluation","band":"higher"},"stimulus":"Umbutho uthi inkqubo yawo inyusa amanqaku. Kwisibhengezo kusetyenziswa impendulo yomfundi omnye. Akunikwa amanqaku angaphambi kwenkqubo okanye iqela lokuthelekisa."}],"created_by":"SmartBridge FET content team","is_published":true,"description":"Mixed grade revision drawn from the other two terms. Includes later-term topics; revisit after studying those topics. Questions are reused deliberately across revision sets.","quiz_type":"practice","difficulty_level":"medium","time_limit_minutes":12,"passing_score_percentage":50,"total_questions":5,"allow_retakes":true,"show_answers_after_submission":true,"tags":["CAPS","ATP","term-4","formative","xhhl"],"metadata":{"term":4,"focus":"Mixed revision: Isishwankathelo nengxoxo exhaswayo; Ukufunda ngeliso elibukhali nokuvavanya ibango","language":"xh","content_version":"2026-10-21.2","content_origin":"SmartBridge original","curriculum_year":2026,"atp_url":"https://www.education.gov.za/LinkClick.aspx?fileticket=hEkvWcfU0LI%3d&tabid=3205&portalid=0&mid=10754","caps_url":"https://www.education.gov.za/LinkClick.aspx?fileticket=QsGQeCZMUxo%3d&tabid=570&portalid=0&mid=1555","retention_circular_url":"https://www.education.gov.za/Portals/0/Documents/Publications/2026/Circulars/Circular%20S19%20of%202025%20and%20Annexures.pdf","verified_on":"2026-10-21","lesson_path":"/study-packs/xhhl-11","coverage":"Selected grade revision from other terms, including later-term content. Not a second paper covering only the selected term.","moderation_status":"Independent teacher and language moderation pending","term_note":"Revision included where specified by ATP; some Grade 10/11 Term 4 plans introduce new content.","set_id":"B","set_label":"Mixed grade revision","cognitive_framework":"CAPS language response: Barrett-informed comprehension and literary analysis","cognitive_levels":["Literal","Reorganisation","Inference","Evaluation","Appreciation"],"classification_status":"Draft author classification; independent moderation pending","assessment_note":"Five-question formative samples do not reproduce formal examination mark weightings or assess extended written responses.","source_terms":[2,3],"atp_urls":["https://www.education.gov.za/LinkClick.aspx?fileticket=hEkvWcfU0LI%3d&tabid=3205&portalid=0&mid=10754"],"question_reuse":"Revision questions recur across term-focused and mixed sets; Set A and Set B within the same selection do not share questions."}},{"id":"b7d43c00-5490-5034-a53f-a9ef419fc0b8","title":"isiZulu HL · Grade 11 · Term 2 selection · Set B: Mixed revision","subject":"isiZulu HL","grade":"Grade 11","questions":[{"question":"Iyiphi inkinga enkulu ebufakazini?","options":["Akekho umuntu ongafunda kulolu hlelo.","Amamaki awakwazi ukukalwa.","Zonke izikhangiso zingamanga.","Umfundi oyedwa akanele ukufakazela umphumela kubo bonke."],"correct_index":3,"explanation":"Isampula incane futhi akukho kuqhathanisa okunikeziwe. Lokhu akufakazeli ukuthi uhlelo alukwazi ukusiza muntu.","stimulus":"Inhlangano ithi uhlelo lwayo lukhuphula amamaki. Esikhangisweni kusebenziswa amazwi omfundi oyedwa. Awanikezwa amamaki angaphambi kohlelo noma iqembu lokuqhathanisa.","cognitive_level":{"code":"L4","label":"Evaluation","band":"higher"}},{"question":"Kungani kubalulekile ukucabanga ngenhloso yombhali?","options":["Inhloso iqinisekisa ukuthi zonke izimangalo ziyiqiniso.","Inhloso isusa isidingo sobufakazi.","Angase afune ukuthengisa uhlelo agcizelele izinzuzo.","Umbhali akakwazi ukukhetha ulwazi."],"correct_index":2,"explanation":"Ukuqonda inhloso yokuthengisa kusiza ukubuza ukuthi yikuphi okugcizelelwe nokushiywe ngaphandle.","stimulus":"Inhlangano ithi uhlelo lwayo lukhuphula amamaki. Esikhangisweni kusebenziswa amazwi omfundi oyedwa. Awanikezwa amamaki angaphambi kohlelo noma iqembu lokuqhathanisa.","cognitive_level":{"code":"L3","label":"Inference","band":"middle"}},{"question":"Yikuphi ukuphikisana okubalulekile?","options":["Ukhiye uphenduka incwadi.","Umbalisi uthi uzohamba kodwa uyama alinde.","Izinyathelo zifika ngokushesha.","Umnyango uyakhuluma."],"correct_index":1,"explanation":"Umehluko phakathi kwesinqumo nesenzo ungaveza ukungaqiniseki noma ukulangazelela ukufika kothile.","stimulus":"Ngabeka ukhiye etafuleni. Ngangithe ngizohamba ngingabheki emuva. Kodwa ngama emnyango ngalinda, ngilalele izinyathelo ezazingafiki.","cognitive_level":{"code":"L3","label":"Inference","band":"middle"}},{"question":"Yikuphi ukuhumusha okusekelwa umbhalo?","options":["Umbalisi akalindi muntu nhlobo.","Ukhiye ufakazela ukuthi indlu iyasha.","Ukulinda kungasikisela ukuthi ukuhamba kunzima kuye.","Olindelwe ngumfowabo ngokuqinisekile."],"correct_index":2,"explanation":"Ukuhumusha okuhle kusebenzisa imininingwane ethile kuvume nokuthi okunye akushiwo.","stimulus":"Ngabeka ukhiye etafuleni. Ngangithe ngizohamba ngingabheki emuva. Kodwa ngama emnyango ngalinda, ngilalele izinyathelo ezazingafiki.","cognitive_level":{"code":"L3","label":"Inference","band":"middle"}},{"question":"Kungani umehluko phakathi kokuthi umbalisi uzohamba nokulinda kwakhe usebenza kahle?","options":["Ufakazela ukuthi umbalisi akakaze afune ukuhamba.","Usitshela igama lomuntu olindelwe.","Uveza ukungqubuzana kwesinqumo nesenzo ngaphandle kokuchaza yonke imbangela.","Ubonisa ukuthi okhiye bayakhuluma."],"correct_index":2,"explanation":"Ukuma nokulinda ngemva kwesinqumo sokuhamba kwakha ukungaqiniseki. Lo mehluko uvumela ukuhumusha okusekelwayo ngaphandle kokwengeza indaba engashiwo embhalweni.","cognitive_level":{"code":"L4","label":"Evaluation","band":"higher"},"stimulus":"Ngabeka ukhiye etafuleni. Ngangithe ngizohamba ngingabheki emuva. Kodwa ngama emnyango ngalinda, ngilalele izinyathelo ezazingafiki."}],"created_by":"SmartBridge FET content team","is_published":true,"description":"Mixed grade revision drawn from the other two terms. Includes later-term topics; revisit after studying those topics. Questions are reused deliberately across revision sets.","quiz_type":"practice","difficulty_level":"medium","time_limit_minutes":12,"passing_score_percentage":50,"total_questions":5,"allow_retakes":true,"show_answers_after_submission":true,"tags":["CAPS","ATP","term-2","formative","zuhl"],"metadata":{"term":2,"focus":"Mixed revision: Ukufunda ngokucophelela nokuhlola isimangalo; Umbalisi nencazelo engashiwo ngqo","language":"zu","content_version":"2026-10-21.2","content_origin":"SmartBridge original","curriculum_year":2026,"atp_url":"https://www.education.gov.za/LinkClick.aspx?fileticket=Fm1a-qg8adg%3d&tabid=3205&portalid=0&mid=10754","caps_url":"https://www.education.gov.za/LinkClick.aspx?fileticket=nZlas4HGdYI%3d&tabid=570&portalid=0&mid=1555","retention_circular_url":"https://www.education.gov.za/Portals/0/Documents/Publications/2026/Circulars/Circular%20S19%20of%202025%20and%20Annexures.pdf","verified_on":"2026-10-21","lesson_path":"/study-packs/zuhl-11","coverage":"Selected grade revision from other terms, including later-term content. Not a second paper covering only the selected term.","moderation_status":"Independent teacher and language moderation pending","term_note":"Revision included where specified by ATP; some Grade 10/11 Term 4 plans introduce new content.","set_id":"B","set_label":"Mixed grade revision","cognitive_framework":"CAPS language response: Barrett-informed comprehension and literary analysis","cognitive_levels":["Literal","Reorganisation","Inference","Evaluation","Appreciation"],"classification_status":"Draft author classification; independent modera